  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/pyjs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Checked py.py @100b6fbb6e: Site-1 stamp still gated on caller_symbol.kind == 'method' (py.py ~9925) and the oracle still takes method_to_enclosing_class_id.get(caller_symbol.id) (~6718). Fixture fx_mosof (Child(Base) in another file, closure cb in Child.run calling self.helper()): the method's call gets enclosing_class and an inherited-calls edge to Base.helper; the closure's call (run.cb, kind=function) has no enclosing_class and stays external:helper. fx_mosof2: self.save() in a model method -> django.db.models:save; same call in a closure -> external:save. Premise holds unchanged. MECHANISM: Site-1 hint and Django-oracle enclosing class are keyed on caller_symbol.kind=='method' / method_to_enclosing_class_id[caller], not on _self_receiver_class_id's positional answer. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-modum."  # 3c74
